---
// src/components/FourStepProcess.astro
---

<section class="py-24 bg-[#070B14] text-white relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-400/20 text-blue-300 text-xs font-telemetry uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Option-Period Velocity
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white">
        The Frictionless 4-Step Inspection Protocol.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Engineered specifically for active Texas real estate transactions where every hour counts.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4-Step Pipeline -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 relative">
      
      <!-- Step 01 -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-blue-500/30 font-telemetry">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Rapid Dispatch</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-blue-400 font-telemetry mb-4">60-Second Online Intake</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Submit property parameters and option-period deadlines. Our team prioritizes active transactions across Dallas, Tarrant, Collin, and Denton counties.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-[11px] font-telemetry text-emerald-400">
          ✓ Priority Calendar Slot Confirmed
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 02 -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-blue-500/30 font-telemetry">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">On-Site PE Audit</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-blue-400 font-telemetry mb-4">60–90 Minute Investigation</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            A state-licensed Professional Engineer conducts an exterior and interior structural inspection, utilizing digital manometers to map floor elevation contours down to 0.01".
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-[11px] font-telemetry text-emerald-400">
          ✓ Digital Elevation Grid Captured
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 03 -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-blue-500/30 font-telemetry">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">CAD Synthesis</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-blue-400 font-telemetry mb-4">Structural Analysis & Modeling</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Telemetry is synthesized into CAD elevation contour drawings and structural load analysis, isolating whether foundation movement is seasonal or requires targeted intervention.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-[11px] font-telemetry text-emerald-400">
          ✓ Certified CAD Drawings Rendered
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 04 -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600/20 text-emerald-400 font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-emerald-500/30 font-telemetry">
            04
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Same-Day Report</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-telemetry mb-4">Official Texas PE Stamped PDF</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Your final, certified engineering report is transmitted digitally to you, your real estate agent, and your lender on the exact same calendar day of the inspection.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-[11px] font-telemetry text-emerald-400">
          ✓ Transmitted Within Hours
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
